<title>CANADA: CBRS confirms Teleglobe Inc debt.</title>
<headline>CBRS confirms Teleglobe Inc debt.</headline>
<dateline>MONTREAL 1996-12-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Canadian Bond Rating Service said it reaffirmed Teleglobe Inc's senior unsecured credit rating at A, first and second preferred shares at P-2 and third series preferred shares at P-2 (low).</p>
<p>The Montreal-based rating agency said its outlook for Teleglobe remains stable.</p>
<p>CBRS said Teleglobe's recent acquisition of a global facilities-based license from the U.S. Federal Communications Commission gives Teleglobe a &quot;strong upside potential in terms of revenue and earnings.&quot;</p>
<p>((Reuters Toronto Bureau 416 941-8100))</p>
